you to maneuver like never before. Play to your chosen faction\u2019s strengths and weaknesses \u2013 take cover behind terrain as the Mechanicus, or destroy it as the Necrons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002090/extras/c99fa04788e22fb1ca89166443555727.avif?t=1759416544\" width=616 height=65 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002090/extras/64e79f71befcdb7a0667e8e87fd2ec5f.avif?t=1759416544\" width=616 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for control of an entire world, capturing and defending regions from the forces of the foe while generating and managing crucial resources. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the Sankhotep dynasty\u2019s global awakening and drive back their deathless legions as the Mechanicus, or defend the tombs of your people as the Necrons and crush the verminous interlopers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the Sankhotep dynasty\u2019s global awakening and drive back their deathless legions as the Mechanicus, or defend the tombs of your people as the Necrons and crush the verminous interlopers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002090/extras/c99fa04788e22fb1ca89166443555727.avif?t=1759416544\" width=616 height=65 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002090/extras/decfd10661d1e1db5e947ab91730612e.avif?t=1759416544\" width=616 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy and upgrade a characterful entourage of Tech-Priest leaders as Magos Dominus Faustinius, or customise your own court of Necron nobles as Vargard N